{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6368cb635c01a45da5fc4265d811712dd14e3bd6b8d1a1be7383bac4fff9ca32", "ja": "（今日は春香の雑誌の撮影だ。テーマはスケルトン。\n撮影スタジオも少し妖しい雰囲気に演出してもらった）", "zh": "（今天是春香拍摄杂志的日子。主题是骷髅。拍摄工作室也特意布置出了一点诡异的氛围）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1001_p", "source_sha256": "85870ceed2750809d48fa6edc0cb2b82e5f6235fef2296397d44f6a90c11179c", "ja": "雰囲気はよく出てるけど、思ったより薄暗いな。\nしかし、春香はどこに……。", "zh": "氛围营造得很到位，不过比想象中昏暗啊。\n可是，春香去哪儿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "60ee5e6487b09122e61481bca7ab8c8b0c6a31246b1b3ccaf79b741b98580409", "ja": "オマエ……ナニシニキタ……", "zh": "你……来这里干什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1003_p", "source_sha256": "688e211873593dc292c2815f0754408880809fe65c9441180a9f02617ae8aaae", "ja": "うわ～っ！？　だ、誰だ……！？", "zh": "哇啊～！？是、是谁……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "20f40752dedccc2710e7e60a9c411bd9b9c29809c395829e76ce2c6f1d3ac834", "ja": "……えへへっ。\n私です、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "……嘿嘿。\n是我，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d6b5ea23d8322b086ad4864b665450b4533bcbe4256722384bf6f394e6d4a87f", "ja": "なんだ、春香か。はあ～、びっくりした……。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是春香啊。哈啊～吓我一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "9090791014f53219308742431e143bdd48e69b3df52b44e66d9f3a6169d91be3", "ja": "すみません！　スケルトンの練習をしてたんですけど。\nまさか、そんなに驚くとは思わなくて……。", "zh": "对不起！我刚才在练习骷髅装来着。\n没想到会让你吓成那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e55392a6400286b4c4bd4301d8c7de4e761f7fac7d00ab93431d382b72ddb3bd", "ja": "そ、そうか。スケルトンの練習……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。练习骷髅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "0d24508cab367d47db8bd60f31865fdb1b1e4893e603ea8936f6e147b3397d96", "ja": "はい！　スケルトンのことを調べたら、操り人形みたい\nに、自我のないタイプが一般的らしいです。", "zh": "是的！我查了一下关于骷髅的资料，听说像木偶一样、没有自我意识的类型比较常见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "a6596279dde230e8f475cf7e1f8b128aeb944842d6483f28c78be241dcadf738", "ja": "だから、どういう演技をしたら、\n私……「天海春香」を消せるのかなって気になって。", "zh": "所以我就在想，要用怎样的演技，才能抹去……“天海春香”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1010_p", "source_sha256": "934a1f89f8fd58f12d194c2a2fc1a61b186845be8653a84eeebfd1ee799c1ce8", "ja": "それで、練習か……。\nそういうことなら、うまくできてたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "所以，是在练习啊……\n既然是这样，那应该演得很不错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "15b0c9c02a70c1c0eaaffd1c521ecb93529f11c621acf056a298e6706a120f3b", "ja": "よかった～。{$P$}さん、\nビクッ！ってしてましたもんね♪", "zh": "太好了～。{$P$}先生，\n刚才不是“嗖”地抖了一下嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a5546e92ef8b4ee26c80748edf0039b4a0ec7380565dccd36fde58834548419f", "ja": "あ、あはは……。でも安心したよ。\nこれなら完成度の高いスケルトンが期待できそうだ！", "zh": "啊，哈哈……不过我就放心了。这样一来，应该能期待完成度很高的骷髅了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "e3d37cb3f2a88b587962a195dec47b7837a1b6303311bd8177f770e8a3e50191", "ja": "任せてください！　……「ワレハ　スケルトン……アツ\nサモサムサモ、カンジナイ……ソウ、ナニモ、カン……", "zh": "交给我吧！……“吾乃骷髅……无论酷暑严寒，都感觉不到……是的，什么都，感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1014_se", "source_sha256": "6f1e669c3a04bc2d1a2be081ec445860f440e0f04657f952320808c31417c408", "ja": "ぐ、ぐぅ～……", "zh": "呜、呜呜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "4b9e4e867b9500bf26612a236bcadf6e0b9e909244927702f72c3fbf33eaeacc", "ja": "きゃっ！　あ、えっと、あはは……！\nうう……。", "zh": "呀！呃，那个，啊哈哈……！\n呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "b4fc474f08a1bcca90d3902b65e312630594afd2cea3193acef9ed01e70669c9", "ja": "き、聞かなかったことにしてください！\nスケルトンは何も感じないし、お腹も空かないので！", "zh": "请、请当作什么都没听见！\n因为骷髅什么感觉都没有，也不会肚子饿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1017_p", "source_sha256": "713bac9d4ce34a2765009e8e8011d41eec47de32f19a3d9d42b93322614f0460", "ja": "ははっ。練習もいいけど、今のうちに、何か食べて\nおいた方がいいかもな。本番でも鳴ったりしたら……。", "zh": "哈哈。练习当然也不错，不过趁现在还有时间，还是先吃点东西比较好。要是正式演出时也响起来的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "033fd93050b4fbea8e2e5e01a2fe1292989cc1ef5e6845116856e083f5fba8bc", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。本当はお腹も空っぽにして\nおきたかったんですけど。ちょっとだけ食べてきます！", "zh": "是、是这样呢……其实我本来想让肚子也空着的。不过我先去吃一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0613_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0613_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3b80b38f2a4b820b5d0eee5ad0d25836f346e968125cc905b6d2c71aa7830938", "ja": "（役作りのためにお腹まで空っぽにしてたのか……。\n撮影が終わったら、美味しいものでもご馳走しよう！）", "zh": "（为了塑造角色，居然连肚子都空着吗……\n拍摄结束后，请她吃点好吃的吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
